      "uid": "zhcn:09fc65927e8fdd5827a369ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙，想要仰望星空——\r\n我原本是这样坚信的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e176d9650c9c1de6207e1adcededf441e3fd5a7aaad2d1f5b8874b92536fbce9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
