      "uid": "zhcn:3409ab738705494f32bbe2a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽就结果而言似乎是对的……\r\n但也许，她也是有些想去庙会玩一玩的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7e4b0f61d6a4b9ef463bc7cecb34aa7c041f37689d1591e66ee31b70343b37b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
