      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我按她所说的那般闭上双眼。\r\n等到她终于小声提醒我『可以睁眼』的时候——",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa89f7e203c10594d2beab0254adae1873bffeae7c64b6dc0b04cd0441e4b369",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d206d934d95c7677ec6b37a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是……银河……吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19d36d8666539c415c2c8747b12f37d801a33eda6cbbc5c83ed1a82b3efe9a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
