      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f284531f361a0d04843fabd8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我眼前的景色，就仿佛——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4010982f8711ec38f7aa9479df47caed9530d2531addbf6bf5977e80e495c8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb155851818ffbc43703ae82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽脚下的确有地面的触感……\r\n我却被眼前这浩瀚星空所吞没，\r\n只觉得所见的一切都只是我脑中的幻象……",
      "source_fingerprint": "499ca5662d70dcc3f73a37b88978b6f7aa729997f835528d2f525b666ca72213",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00dde730e7b15ac4d855b415",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她先前，的确是说了『会相当耀眼』，\r\n那么这一切究竟是……\r\n因这面前的景色过于震撼，我倒退好几步，险些脚下不稳——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d8de3ef1b1b69d1ac1f92ff6b27f72651f105937fa0dc26ccad451d69a67b9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b887a91f5e9648d22068c15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105007.json",
      "json_path": [
