    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4438eb9f6f8b17d1b55afb3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙回答我的问题时，看上去倒还挺开心的。\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "2730621f7ab7b15d5a09802f160f1c092733bbcfecb66238960f2ccf414588b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5d99415ecda91c88434dd3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知是错觉还是真心——\r\n不管如何……现在的我，正『心动不已』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6092c50142bce732f8dc498cd14418e9f87c48ab5c7b8c1f1f638400743f516",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ec1e04655a624ef0983fe0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……感觉，稍微能“观测”到你一些了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3f78b501d512684455cd56511ea8da07b3442f9e822cb88f2e7aeefcfd438b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105007.json",
