        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78f97e682cee206c61911c68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而新宇宙，则看上去——似乎有些害羞的样子。\r\n……是我的错觉吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d499a95a5a9b8642c88882dbb9c13abdf57e3c65264d38ef0f3a8d3ff7f4ea8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
