    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83189ed8d0d1276692c63228",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙——露出了让群星都为之的消融的，\r\n天真无邪的笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d6064b849f68216d82c5aa8e84ca74c085add69e119fa0398f0dfa7b7577a9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
