      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c94a1179b7867a42c625a4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说出口后，我立刻暗叫不妙。\r\n这话听着，简直就像我是个偷窥狂似的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c2aeae9fd9776c6e77021994866c3bc52d2da4276d099840f174ed513a31f0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b4734e980c4bd4d1e37b47f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我连忙解释说，我只是作为训练员，\r\n想要更了解自己的签约赛马娘而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "585e9c9e3c8e057d8b72f7b18a03210fecef4d79ae66a68d8362f45855dacbc3",
