    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce0918147c50ede0700b326",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "糟糕，我们快走吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d37ec5564d6bc213dc72969e7f024af3620cc2d6660206d32fc4ee7b20b7a96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0202cfc52a0d7125c587acf0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那些赛马娘们开始慢慢沿着操场的外围跑了起来，\n能力上也没有让人特别在意的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aa27946f2d48b6b248fd5d8a916ae596c6a73f8e69fea435cd194bc4a04d580",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92227f8f81e7bbfe07fcfca0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那些赛马娘当中，悠闲的银发赛马娘跑得特别慢，\n其他成员都开始做伸展运动了，但她却还在操场上跑着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1792e2668744323cea788e01d11d86713825d7139148fe6302a36b3438ee91a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ba61e14cb19d066ce1b2be3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "悠闲的赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "95d639042f72ca6f2881171999cfd542c110ad8cbd4d324630df41423cb0650a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a508c21179bd34d2e0ae45b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿……不用拍我这里啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b47ad98335e95b9d7e7e9941e88691e86dab9abf5555e0921732343a57b992a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:810a494a46bd9fdf430dd954",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……为什么我会这么在意她呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d939a4fadbf232a0d7cbdb2bea9e0dcdb3fc61c9e7ac94a33c38b09fd2150ac0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00120a5598390630dfcdfce2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然不知道原因，但有些地方让我很在意──\n于是我决定找一天去见见这位赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "effbb9896eb71b7b736947b6f5a1428696fafb6abe553e85956fdcc8b0ba645e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dbd1dbf88bd97ef9f438f38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（真是相当缓慢的跑法呢……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d31cede78964b6a11794b5d265c30e2c1679ada2694edc8dd3edc7a15a90427",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
