      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a79b09f86fd394581fa3e8cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那位赛马娘虽然参加了并跑练习，\n但却没办法跟对手并排，而是渐渐地被拉开了距离。",
      "source_fingerprint": "521f3914f8aee1572931c6fccd849c299ff3472d723888956f232acd00028091",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcce1914246db0c9f1f8859a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结果跑到最后，\n那位赛马娘都没有特别亮眼的表现──",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f35538d1ea16e315fe2fe21d000fcda4a6e72f023ad7f48888102e1acf458e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1106/storytimeline_041106001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
